---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Munex"
	description="Learn about Munex - your trusted source for AI tools reviews, SaaS comparisons, and productivity insights."
	pubDate={new Date('January 01 2025')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<h2>Welcome to Munex</h2>
	<p>
		<strong>Munex</strong> is your go-to resource for in-depth reviews, comparisons, and guides on AI tools, 
		SaaS software, and productivity applications. We help businesses and professionals make informed 
		decisions about the tools that power their work.
	</p>

	<h2>Our Mission</h2>
	<p>
		In a world overflowing with software options, finding the right tool can be overwhelming. 
		Our mission is to cut through the noise and provide honest, experience-based reviews that 
		help you choose the perfect solutions for your needs.
	</p>

	<h2>What We Cover</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>AI Tools & Automation</strong> — Reviews of ChatGPT, Claude, and emerging AI assistants</li>
		<li><strong>SaaS Software</strong> — CRM, email marketing, project management comparisons</li>
		<li><strong>Productivity Apps</strong> — Time management, remote work, and collaboration tools</li>
		<li><strong>How-To Guides</strong> — Step-by-step tutorials for getting the most out of your tools</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Our Editorial Standards</h2>
	<p>
		Every review on Munex is based on hands-on experience. We don't just read feature lists — 
		we actually use the tools we review. Our team tests software in real-world scenarios to 
		provide insights you can trust.
	</p>

	<h3>Our Review Process</h3>
	<ol>
		<li><strong>Hands-On Testing</strong> — We use each tool for at least 2 weeks before reviewing</li>
		<li><strong>Feature Analysis</strong> — Comprehensive breakdown of capabilities and limitations</li>
		<li><strong>Pricing Transparency</strong> — Clear cost comparisons with no hidden fees</li>
		<li><strong>Real User Feedback</strong> — We incorporate community experiences and feedback</li>
		<li><strong>Regular Updates</strong> — Reviews are updated when tools receive major changes</li>
	</ol>

	<h2>Why Trust Munex?</h2>
	<p>
		We maintain strict editorial independence. While we may earn affiliate commissions from 
		some links, this never influences our recommendations. We recommend tools based on merit, 
		not commission rates.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have a tool you'd like us to review? Found an error in our content? We'd love to hear from you. 
		Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> to reach out.
	</p>

	<p>
		<em>Thank you for choosing Munex as your trusted software guide.</em>
	</p>
</Layout>
